{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-24","kind":"proposition","title":"相等两直线上作相似两圆分必等","englishTitle":"Similar segments of circles on equal straight lines are equal to one another.","book":3,"number":24,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.24","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.24/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":24,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-24@raw-41e62100fec9b392","contentId":"euclid-3-24","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"41e62100fec9b392bc6ad0c42a1222e0a3753b19ecdf7fae54e359abd9a3ef31","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-24.statement","euclid-3-24.construction.1","euclid-3-24.proof.1","euclid-3-24.proof.2","euclid-3-24.proof.3","euclid-3-24.conclusion","euclid-3-24.historical.1","euclid-3-24.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-24.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-24","revisionId":"euclid-3-24@raw-41e62100fec9b392","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8428c6b7a65fd08eea3d9db8cfec8ed94d85a4a6fd0eca052690b06ef24f46c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similar segments of circles on equal straight lines are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"平直线上的类似圆圈的相等部分是等同的。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"相等两直线上作相似两圜分必等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在两条相等的直线上绘制相似弧线必须是相等的"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-24.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-24","revisionId":"euclid-3-24@raw-41e62100fec9b392","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e618071c78b249eae05c0eb7df5b03a62472bb97d1c3dd8b9149a051d88ddb6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AEB, CFD be similar segments of circles on equal straight lines AB, CD; I say that the segment AEB is equal to the segment CFD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AEB,CFD圈子在平线上类似AB,CD;我说,第AEB相当于第CFD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-24.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-24","revisionId":"euclid-3-24@raw-41e62100fec9b392","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f71aa228abea4593a6c6bdeec5537888d2bd72d96708979794a1f6876fde85f4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if the segment AEB be applied to CFD, and if the point A be placed on C and the straight line AB on CD, the point B will also coincide with the point D, because AB is equal to CD; and, AB coinciding with CD, the segment AEB will also coincide with CFD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果第AEB段适用于CFD段,如果将第A点放在C点上,将第CD段直线AB线放在CD上,则第B点也将与第D点一致,因为第AB点等于CD;第AB点与第CD点同时,第AEB点也与第CFD点一致。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-24.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-24","revisionId":"euclid-3-24@raw-41e62100fec9b392","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"09b3d854c3cce479b442ce1d0b918b749aef368eac50b8adc2d2e19cc722ec0a","citations":["euclid-3-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if the straight line AB coincide with CD but the segment AEB do not coincide with CFD, it will either fall with it, or outside it; or it will fall awry, as CGD, and a circle cuts a circle at more points than two : which is impossible. [[III. 10](/principles/euclid-3-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果AB直线与CD线相吻合,但第AEB段与CFD段不吻合,那么它要么与CFD线并排,要么在CGD线之外,或者掉下来,因为CGD线,圆圈在两个以上点上截断一个圆圈:这是不可能做到的。 [[III. 10](/principles/euclid-3-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-24.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-24","revisionId":"euclid-3-24@raw-41e62100fec9b392","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c4ded4140f8a2febfef25d9aa94f938cd6ebd56fc65b6b3b90073c597e25647c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, if the straight line AB be applied to CD, the segment AEB will not fail to coincide with CFD also; therefore it will coincide with it and will be equal to it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果对CD直线AB适用,第AEB段也与CFD段不吻合,因此与该段相吻合,并将等于该段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-24.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-24","revisionId":"euclid-3-24@raw-41e62100fec9b392","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-24.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-24","revisionId":"euclid-3-24@raw-41e62100fec9b392","order":6,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"226babd032d8ba65fbb8112ead48d0c09c7d7fea26582f79533cc0e27a1f7e72","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"相等两直线上作相似两圜分必等解曰甲乙丙丁两线上作甲丙乙丙己丁相似两圜分题言两圜分等论曰甲乙丙丁两线既等试以甲乙线加丙丁线上两线必相合即甲丙乙丙己丁两圜分相加亦相合如云不然必两圜分相加或在内或在外或半在内半在外矣若在内在外即一直线上有两圜分相似而不相等也〈本篇廿三〉若半在内半在外即两圜三相交也〈本篇十〉两俱不可故相似者必等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在两条相等的直线上绘制相似弧线必须解释如下：甲乙丙丁 在两条直线上绘制两个相似的弧线 甲丙乙丙己丁 两个弧相等的命题解释如下：甲乙丙丁 如果两条直线相等，尝试加入 甲乙 到 丙丁，那么这两条直线必须会聚，也就是 甲丙乙丙己丁 两个弧线的和也会汇聚，否则两个弧必须在内部或外部，或者半在内部半在外部。如果半在内部半在外部，则直线上的两个弧相似但不相等。〈本篇廿三〉 如果半在内部半在外部，则两个圆和三个点相交。〈本篇十〉 都不可能，所以相似性必须相等"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-24.source","contentId":"euclid-3-24","revisionId":"euclid-3-24@raw-41e62100fec9b392","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c9aa5d53835034bab651b150b43048c269e2755342919a4b59f9d33e079556a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.24/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.24\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-24:euclid-3-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-24","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-24.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-10","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.24","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.24/","sourceLabel":"III. 10"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-26:euclid-3-24:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-26","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-26.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-24","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.26","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.26/","sourceLabel":"III. 24"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-24:euclid-3-10:explicit","id":"euclid-3-10","book":3,"number":10,"kind":"proposition","title":"两个圆至多相交于两点","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-26:euclid-3-24:explicit","id":"euclid-3-26","book":3,"number":26,"kind":"proposition","title":"等圆之乘圆分角或在心或在界等其所乘之圆分亦等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-circle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
